--- OVERVIEW: pph3 (top-level ArcaNN labeling) ---

NOTE: despite the shared name, this folder is unrelated to LFER/LFER_3_mg2/pph3/ (the
tri-protonated-pyrophosphate free-energy study) -- this one is an ArcaNN active-learning
labeling batch for the pph3 system's training set.

o 002-labeling/   the CP2K DFT labeling calculations for this batch -- see its README.
o JOBS/           raw SLURM job scratch/output directories (JOB-<id>/ per job), auto-
                   generated by the job submission tooling -- not documented individually,
                   same treatment as the top-level ../JOBS/ (see ../README).

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
